"Drag and drop manufacturing orders to spread evenly the load between "
"Mayonnaise\n"
"        manufacturing and packaging into buckets and dispensers.<br/>You're "
"all set for production!"
msgstr ""
"拖放制造订单，以便在蛋黄酱制造和分装到桶及分装瓶的任务之间均匀分配负载。<br/>"
"您已为生产做好一切准备！"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model:x_nutritional_facts,x_name:food_distribution.x_nutritional_facts_1
msgid "Energy"
msgstr "能量"

#. module: food_distribution
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:food_distribution.food_distribution_inherit_report_lot_label
