"In food distribution, you need to efficiently identify lots contaminated by "
"non-compliant ingredients, contact impacted customers and scrap those."
msgstr ""
"在食品分销中，您需要高效地识别被不合规配料污染的批次，联系受影响的客户并将其"
"报废。"

